<title>INDIA: India ITC to meet for results on May 28.</title>
<headline>India ITC to meet for results on May 28.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The board of Indian tobacco conglomerate ITC Industries will meet on May 28 to announce first half results for the year ending March 31, 1997, the firm said in a statement to the Bombay Stock Exchange on Monday.</p>
<p>The accounts will be unaudited, the company said.</p>
<p>Shares of ITC ended 5.50 rupees, down at 400.75 at the BSE on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Bombay equities desk +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
